s editor, Owen Scott Muir, M.D., DFAACAP, FCTMSS is at the Lake.\n\nAn Island in the middle of Lake Sunapee, NH.\n\nI'm working on some longer form writing.\n\nI might get some articles done.\n\nToday, for your amusement, I will share this podcast interview from back in the day, on the fantastic suicide-prevention podcast “Before You Kill Yourself” with Leo Flowers. We talk about bipolar disorder and staying curious.\n\nAs a reminder, I have a book —Inessential Pharmacology, on Amazon.\n\nSubscribe now\n\nOther classics from TFPs on bipolar disorder include the following:\n\nAnd of course, an all time favorite from my readers:\n\nThanks for reading, listening, sharing, and subscribing.\n\nSubscribe now\n\nShare"}